                {"我指向开始暗下来的天空。视线的尽头,立着一株格外高大的丝柏。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00100",
        linknext = "block_00102"
    },
    block_00102 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"宛如映在天空中的黑影一般――。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00101",
        linknext = "block_00103"
    },
    block_00103 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"我一指过去,那只鸟便用非常,非常美丽的声音,啼叫起来。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00102",
        linknext = "block_00104"
    },
    block_00104 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「那是知更鸟？　对吧……。总不可能……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00103",
        linknext = "block_00105"
    },
    block_00105 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100695", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「大概,是知更鸟吧……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00104",
        linknext = "block_00106"
    },
    block_00106 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「不过,离得太远,看着也像别的什么……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00105",
        linknext = "block_00107"
    },
    block_00107 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100696", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「样子几乎只剩剪影,看不清楚……但我总觉得,那叫声不太像知更鸟",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00106",
        linknext = "block_00108"
    },
    block_00108 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「禀觉得,那鸟叫声像是什么？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00107",
        linknext = "block_00109"
    },
    block_00109 = {
        {"cgdel", id = 9, time = 1000, lv = 9},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100697", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「我因为工作去过几次欧洲。很像那时听到的鸣叫声」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00108",
        linknext = "block_00110"
    },
    block_00110 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"鸟再次啼鸣。在黄昏的天空下,仿佛在向着黑夜歌唱――。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00109",
        linknext = "block_00111"
    },
    block_00111 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100698", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「直君觉得,那只鸟,如果不是知更鸟的话,会是什么？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00110",
        linknext = "block_00112"
    },
    block_00112 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「虽然几乎没那个可能……,但那身影和叫声……让我觉得像是小夜啼",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "鸟」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00111",
        linknext = "block_00113"
    },
    block_00113 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100699", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「小夜啼鸟……那是和名呢」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00112",
        linknext = "block_00114"
    },
    block_00114 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "那种鸟作为往返于欧洲与非洲之间的候鸟而闻名,在欧洲的童话里也",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "能见到它的名字。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00113",
        linknext = "block_00115"
    },
    block_00115 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"然而,那种鸟在日本是见不到的。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00114",
        linknext = "block_00116"
    },
    block_00116 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"夜莺。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00115",
        linknext = "block_00117"
    },
    block_00117 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100700", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「夜莺什么的,不可能出现在日本的……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00116",
        linknext = "block_00118"
    },
    block_00118 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "小夜啼鸟,别名又叫夜莺。夜莺一词在古英语中,意为「在夜里歌唱」",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00117",
        linknext = "block_00119"
    },
    block_00119 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "和名的小夜啼鸟写成汉字是「小夜啼鸟」,同样也是「在夜里啼鸣/",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "歌唱之物」的意思。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00118",
        linknext = "block_00120"
    },
    block_00120 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「是人家养的逃出来了吗？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00119",
        linknext = "block_00121"
    },
    block_00121 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100701", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「如果是那样的话,好可怜呢……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00120",
        linknext = "block_00122"
    },
    block_00122 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「如果那真是小夜啼鸟的话……」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00121",
        linknext = "block_00123"
    },
    block_00123 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    "夜莺虽然是可以正常买卖的鸟,但逃走的小夜啼鸟在这里野生化的事",
                    {"rt2"},
                    ",我从没听说过。"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00122",
        linknext = "block_00124"
    },
    block_00124 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"从笼中逃出的夜莺,孤身一只,是无法在这片土地上活下去的。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00123",
        linknext = "block_00125"
    },
    block_00125 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"丝柏上的夜莺,虽然看起来仿佛一直注视着我们――。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00124",
        linknext = "block_00126"
    },
    block_00126 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"却只让美丽的歌声响起了一次――便径直消失在了天空中。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00125",
        linknext = "block_00127"
    },
    block_00127 = {
        {"cgdel", id = -1},
        {"bg", file = "ev_app_h15_01", time = 1000, path = ":ev/ev_app_h15/", set = "ev_app_h15"},
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100702", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「飞走了呢」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00126",
        linknext = "block_00128"
    },
    block_00128 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「啊,果然,它并不是在看我们吧？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00127",
        linknext = "block_00129"
    },
    block_00129 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100703", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「谁知道呢」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00128",
        linknext = "block_00130"
    },
    block_00130 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100704", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「大概,说它没在看我们,应该是对的……不过」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00129",
        linknext = "block_00131"
    },
    block_00131 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"直哉"},
                    "「不过？」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00130",
        linknext = "block_00132"
    },
    block_00132 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100705", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「不,没什么」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00131",
        linknext = "block_00133"
    },
    block_00133 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"前天夜里。我仿佛听见了她的啼鸣。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00132",
        linknext = "block_00134"
    },
    block_00134 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"被称作夜啼之鸟、墓场之鸟的,夜莺。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00133",
        linknext = "block_00135"
    },
    block_00135 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"那大概,是一场梦吧。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00134",
        linknext = "block_00136"
    },
    block_00136 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"我把梦中听到的那歌声,也投影到了刚才看见的鸟身上。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00135",
        linknext = "block_00137"
    },
    block_00137 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"所以,那大概是知更鸟。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00136",
        linknext = "block_00138"
    },
    block_00138 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"雌知更鸟的样子和夜莺很像。连叫声也像。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00137",
        linknext = "block_00139"
    },
    block_00139 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"所以,不熟悉鸟类的我们,把这两种鸟认错,也不足为奇。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00138",
        linknext = "block_00140"
    },
    block_00140 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100706", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「这种地方,不可能有夜莺的」"
                }
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00139",
        linknext = "block_00141"
    },
    block_00141 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"即便如此,总觉得,那只鸟――。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00140",
        linknext = "block_00142"
    },
    block_00142 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            ja = {
                {"似乎一直在看着直君。"}
            }
        },
        linkback = "block_00141",
        linknext = "block_00143"
    },
    block_00143 = {
        {"text"},
        text = {
            vo = {
                {"vo", file = "fem_rnd_100707", ch = "rnd"}
            },
            ja = {
                {
                    name = {"禀"},
                    "「说不定,它是为了心爱的男子性,为了把白蔷薇染红,而来做最后的",
                    {"rt2"},
                    "道别的」"
                }
            }
